  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>From energy conservation,</p><p>[after bullet gets embedded till the system comes momentarily at rest]</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfenced><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math><br />[<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> is velocity after collision]&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>&#963;</mi><mi>h</mi></msqrt></math></p><p>Applying momentum conservation, (just before and just after collision)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfenced><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mfenced><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8776;</mo><mn>831</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>55</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
